msgstr "School participation in the edition, a comparison with the previous edition and – once results are published – means and the number of qualified students."

#, python-format
msgid "Średnie i liczby zakwalifikowanych grup mniejszych niż %(k)s wpisów są ukryte – także w eksporcie CSV i w raportach PDF."
msgstr "Means and qualified counts of groups with fewer than %(k)s entries are hidden – also in the CSV export and in the PDF reports."

